{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Delta Force is back!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The iconic series returns as the definitive free-to-play modern team-based tactical shooter, and featuring four distinct gameplay modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Warfare: battle the enemy across land, sea and air in truly epic 32 v 32 PvP combat, featuring a wide range of vehicles and unique tactical gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Operations: Delta Force meets the next generation extraction shooter as you deploy behind enemy lines with your squad, search for valuables, take on rival players, and extract before it\u2019s too late. Alternatively, our PvE Raid mode offers challenging objective-based missions designed to push your squad to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Black Hawk Down: step into the boots of legendary Delta Force operators for this remake of the classic series campaign based on the gripping 2001 movie.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are committed to NO PAY-TO-WIN and development is driven by community feedback. Fair play is a top priority, and our dedicated G.T.I. security anti-cheat team ensures a fair gameplay experience by proactively targeting and removing cheaters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And remember\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cNo-one gets left behind\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/BHD_EN_012125.gif?t=1741233602\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/Warfare_EN_012125.gif?t=1741233602\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/Operation_EN_012125.gif?t=1741233602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/Weapon_EN_1205.gif?t=1741233602\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/Monetization_EN_012125.gif?t=1741233602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/Anti_Cheats_EN_012125.gif?t=1741233602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/SQUAD_EN_1205.gif?t=1741233602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/Community_EN_012125.gif?t=1741233602\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Words from the Game Director, Shadow Guo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>As a player:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delta Force was the first shooter I ever played, igniting my passion for the genre. I'm extremely grateful for the opportunity to create Delta Force, and my goal is to share that unforgettable joy with even more players. I hope this new Delta Force game will become the tactical FPS experience I dreamt of all those years ago. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>As a Game Director:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're pushing Unreal Engine to its limits to deliver a truly cross-platform experience that allows players worldwide to immerse themselves in a vivid world of deep characters, explosive destruction, and top-notch action...all worthy of the &quot;Delta Force&quot; name. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join me in crafting a game for all Delta Force players - Delta Force, a game for us all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Top Agent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2507950/dd1857c1760bfb444a5d8b8075b50c774a2b6cba.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran Operator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2507950/40a90c0f2d9ae33e1067f18d117968e26e494e84.jpg"},{"name":"Field Marshal ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2507950/3f0e4bc68063bccb9f2d19619a898c230b7b131f.jpg"},{"name":"Field Vanguard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2507950/76401240bc86a4e8731344974ee5edec9af2fc34.jpg"},{"name":"Everlasting Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2507950/5801bcfb0bc4349a8e301d62c02ff1ff2170831d.jpg"},{"name":"Military Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2507950/3d14ed2735dc5496fc6c482b7047367c642c5992.jpg"},{"name":"Mechanical Cardio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2507950/5b6d17eaaa4eb97e6f7091553e368cd0f78f0f85.jpg"},{"name":"Physical Hacker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2507950/c039e165cd0410891faeb015c2a42b778e9a636b.jpg"},{"name":"Next-Gen Material","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2507950/3d4bef4a33c59aa4fad770df55a4da04774eed1c.jpg"},{"name":"Precise Detection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2507950/aea32c7d3a45d1c125d70ce469289708b7c0ff0f.jpg"}],"total":53},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2507950?t=1741233602","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741233602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/b029b3c8740b9ceb997ad832ea12afa20652df1b/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1741233602","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/b029b3c8740b9ceb997ad832ea12afa20652df1b/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1741233602","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Season Starfall Events and Rewards</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/S3_Updates_EN.png?t=1741233602\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/S\u82f1\u6587.jpg?t=1741233602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Delta Force is back!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The iconic series returns as the definitive free-to-play modern team-based tactical shooter, and featuring four distinct gameplay modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Warfare: battle the enemy across land, sea and air in truly epic 32 v 32 PvP combat, featuring a wide range of vehicles and unique tactical gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Operations: Delta Force meets the next generation extraction shooter as you deploy behind enemy lines with your squad, search for valuables, take on rival players, and extract before it\u2019s too late. Alternatively, our PvE Raid mode offers challenging objective-based missions designed to push your squad to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Black Hawk Down: step into the boots of legendary Delta Force operators for this remake of the classic series campaign based on the gripping 2001 movie.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are committed to NO PAY-TO-WIN and development is driven by community feedback. Fair play is a top priority, and our dedicated G.T.I. security anti-cheat team ensures a fair gameplay experience by proactively targeting and removing cheaters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And remember\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cNo-one gets left behind\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/BHD_EN_012125.gif?t=1741233602\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/Warfare_EN_012125.gif?t=1741233602\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/Operation_EN_012125.gif?t=1741233602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/Weapon_EN_1205.gif?t=1741233602\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/Monetization_EN_012125.gif?t=1741233602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/Anti_Cheats_EN_012125.gif?t=1741233602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/SQUAD_EN_1205.gif?t=1741233602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/Community_EN_012125.gif?t=1741233602\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Words from the Game Director, Shadow Guo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>As a player:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delta Force was the first shooter I ever played, igniting my passion for the genre. I'm extremely grateful for the opportunity to create Delta Force, and my goal is to share that unforgettable joy with even more players. I hope this new Delta Force game will become the tactical FPS experience I dreamt of all those years ago. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>As a Game Director:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're pushing Unreal Engine to its limits to deliver a truly cross-platform experience that allows players worldwide to immerse themselves in a vivid world of deep characters, explosive destruction, and top-notch action...all worthy of the &quot;Delta Force&quot; name. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join me in crafting a game for all Delta Force players - Delta Force, a game for us all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Team Jade"],"dlc":[2918370],"ext_user_account_notice":"LEVEL INFINITE PASS (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1741233602","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100297,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100297/movie480.mp